@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceFontName Arial

actor User
participant MainViewModel
participant UpdateService
participant "SFTP Server" as SFTP

User -> MainViewModel: Check Update
MainViewModel -> UpdateService: Start Check
UpdateService -> SFTP: Connect
SFTP --> UpdateService: Connected
UpdateService -> SFTP: Get HashList
SFTP --> UpdateService: HashList
UpdateService -> SFTP: List Files
SFTP --> UpdateService: File List
MainViewModel -> UpdateService: Download
UpdateService -> SFTP: Download Files
SFTP --> UpdateService: Files Downloaded
UpdateService --> MainViewModel: Complete
MainViewModel --> User: Complete
@enduml 